### Firebase SDK for Cloud Functions > HTTPS Request Handler

Source: https://context7.com/firebase/firebase-functions/llms.txt

Create HTTP endpoints that handle incoming requests with Express-style request/response objects. These functions can be configured with options such as region, memory allocation, timeout, and CORS settings. They allow for processing query parameters, handling different HTTP methods, and sending JSON responses or error messages.
